  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>복사 평형 실험에서 각 반의 평균 값을 얻고, 그래프로 보여주기 위해 사용한 시트입니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1muakL8vnOWdSAzx8jpAdNrEulvDgwFX8MQHKKY1W_EA/copy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1muakL8vnOWdSAzx8jpAdNrEulvDgwFX8MQHKKY1W_EA/copy</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>각 모둠의 측정값을 입력하면 자동으로 가장 아래 행에 평균값이 계산됩니다.</p><p>아래는 실제로 학생들이 수업중 &#160;입력한 &#160;값의 일부입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe969756b46d6b1f8013d43c36295831038d4563\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe969756b46d6b1f8013d43c36295831038d4563\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"293\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>삽입-차트를 통해 그래프로도 보여줬습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/183f9657ed071b8bc11456d7cc0014d08b31e971\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/183f9657ed071b8bc11456d7cc0014d08b31e971\" data-origin-width=\"555\" data-origin-height=\"277\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0ab96742255ddc9ec40bd248a41b6915a427dfe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0ab96742255ddc9ec40bd248a41b6915a427dfe\" data-origin-width=\"681\" data-origin-height=\"413\"></div><p>기록 담당자 역할을 따로 부여하고, qr코드를 학습지에 넣어 쉽게 접속하도록 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a99e0bb8b3a57976eb1eef9613e337c8487dcf7d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a99e0bb8b3a57976eb1eef9613e337c8487dcf7d\" data-origin-width=\"1071\" data-origin-height=\"834\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>시트사용하실 때 사본만들기로 저장하신 후 사용해주세요 !!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be0715059cba1f22aeb6d659f00f768cdbe84be0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be0715059cba1f22aeb6d659f00f768cdbe84be0\" data-origin-width=\"374\" data-origin-height=\"239\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
